<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/fraction_model.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>
<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 26 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">FractionWord Problems</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">整體嘅幾分之幾 · 分母唔等於整體 · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 分母唔等於整體！「整體嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>」vs「2 個」係兩回事！<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L25 同分母Fraction加減<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 整體的幾分之幾 ❷ 求部分量 ❸ Fraction比較應用 ❹ 文字解題<br/>
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維》3下B冊 單元六
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🍕 分數大作戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">通分、約分、四則混合！避開分母陷阱。連續答對分數翻倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>一盒糖有 10 粒。<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 盒即係幾粒？（10 嘅一半 = ？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>12 個蘋果，<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 係幾多個？（12 ÷ 3 = ？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>一條繩長 20 cm，用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>，用了幾多 cm？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>24 粒糖，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>，吃了幾粒？（24÷4 = 1份，再x3）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>一個蛋糕切 8 件。「<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> 個蛋糕」= 幾多件？（小心：8件係整體！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：「整體嘅幾分之幾」點計？<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>「整體嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">a</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">b</span></span>」</strong> = 整體 ÷ b x a<br/>
② <strong>步驟：</strong>先 ÷ 分母（搵出1份），再 x 分子（搵出a份）<br/>
③ 例：20 嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> → 20÷5=<strong>4</strong>（1份），4x3=<strong>12</strong>（3份）<br/>
④ <strong>Mnemonic：</strong>「先除分母搵一份，再乘分子就搞掂！」
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：整體嘅幾分之幾</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">🍬 一盒糖有 30 粒。小明吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 盒。他吃了多少粒？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Step 1：</strong>搵 1 份 → 30 ÷ 5 = 6 粒<br/><strong>Step 2：</strong>搵 2 份 → 6 x 2 = <strong>12 粒</strong><br/>答：小明吃了 12 粒糖。<br/>驗證：12 ÷ 30 = <span class="f"><span class="n">12</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">30</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> ✓</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 2：分母唔係整體！</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">「我有 5 粒糖，吃了 2 粒。」vs「我有 5 粒糖，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>。」有咩分別？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">⚠️ 容易混淆</div><div class="eq">吃了 2 粒 = 吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span></div><div class="why">呢兩個講法嘅意思一樣！因為整體係5粒，2粒就係<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>。但換咗整體就唔同！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">🔑 關鍵區分</div><div class="eq">20粒糖，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = 8粒</div><div class="why">分母5代表將20粒分成5份，2份=8粒。20粒嘅<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>唔係2粒！</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 終極Trap：分母唔等於整體！分母只代表「將整體分成幾多份」，份數會隨整體大小改變！</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 必問自己：「整體係幾多？」先搵出整體，再除分母、乘分子！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>15 個蘋果嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = 幾個？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>24 本書嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = 幾本？（24÷4=6，6x3=?）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>40 元嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = 幾多元？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>60 個學生嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 係幾多個學生？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：FractionWord Problems — 求剩餘<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>典型題型：</strong>知道整體和用了的幾分之幾，求剩餘<br/>
② <strong>方法一：</strong>整體 - 用了的 = 剩餘（先計用了的數量）<br/>
③ <strong>方法二：</strong>1 - 用了的幾分之幾 = 剩餘的幾分之幾，再乘整體<br/>
④ 兩種方法都得，選你覺得容易嘅！
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3：求剩餘</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">一本書有 48 頁，小明看了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。還有多少頁未看？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;"><strong>方法一：</strong>看了 = 48÷8x3 = 6x3 = 18頁。剩餘 = 48-18 = <strong>30頁</strong><br/><strong>方法二：</strong>未看 = 1 - <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。48÷8x5 = 6x5 = <strong>30頁</strong> ✓</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 4：比較題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">哥哥有 36 粒糖，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>。妹妹有 24 粒糖，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>。誰吃了更多粒？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">哥哥吃了：36÷4 = <strong>9 粒</strong><br/>妹妹吃了：24÷3 = <strong>8 粒</strong><br/>9 &gt; 8，所以<strong>哥哥</strong>吃了更多！<br/>（雖然 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> &lt; <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>，但哥哥整體大好多！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>一條絲帶長 32 cm，用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。還剩多少 cm？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>一盒 20 支鉛筆，送了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 給朋友。送了多少支？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>A 班有 30 人，<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 是女生。B 班有 24 人，<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 是女生。哪班女生較多？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：Fraction解題策略<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>讀題三步：</strong>搵整體 → 確認幾分之幾 → 決定計法<br/>
② <strong>關鍵詞：</strong>「用了」、「吃了」、「送了」→ 問「部分」<br/>
③ <strong>「剩餘」、「還有」</strong> → 整體減部分<br/>
④ <strong>畫圖輔助：</strong>用長條圖幫自己理解！
</div></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
