<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>20 元嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = 幾元？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>一盒 18 粒朱古力，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>。吃了幾粒？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>35 個汽球嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> 係紅色。紅色汽球有幾多個？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>一本書有 56 頁，看了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>。還有多少頁未看？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>小明儲了 45 元，用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> 買玩具。他還有多少元？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>一籃水果有 48 個。<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 是蘋果，<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 是橙，其餘是香蕉。香蕉有幾個？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>一條馬路長 72 米。第一日修了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>，第二日修了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>。兩日共修了多少米？還剩多少米？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>A 有 60 元，B 有的錢是 A 的 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>。C 有的錢是 B 的 2 倍。C 有多少元？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活Word Problems（共 5 題）<span class="star">🎯</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>🍪 一盒曲奇有 28 塊。下午茶吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>。吃了幾塊？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>📚 書架有 40 本書。<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 是故事書。故事書有幾多本？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>🎈 50 個汽球，<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 是紅色，<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 是藍色。紅色同藍色共有幾個？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>🌳 公園有 63 棵樹。<span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> 開花了。有幾多棵未開花？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>🎂 媽媽做了 54 個餃子。爸爸吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>，媽媽吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span>。誰吃得多？剩多少個？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）<span class="star">📝</span></div>
