<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>判斷：50 嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 同 100 嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>，邊個大？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
