<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)題（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>一籃蛋有 36 隻。<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 是白色，其餘是啡色。啡色蛋有幾多隻？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>全班有 42 人。<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> 戴眼鏡，<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> 是女生且戴眼鏡。不戴眼鏡的有幾人？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>爸爸今年 36 歲，小明歲數是爸爸的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>。3 年後小明幾歲？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error</th><th>Correct Approach</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>分母當成整體數量</strong>：20嘅<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>=2</td><td>先除分母：20÷5=4，再乘分子：4x2=8</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>忘記「先除後乘」嘅次序</strong></td><td>整體 ÷ 分母 x 分子（呢個次序！）</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>不同整體直接比較Fraction</strong></td><td>先計出實際數量，再比較！</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>求剩餘時整體減錯</strong></td><td>整體 - 用咗嘅 = 剩餘（用咗嘅要先用Fraction計出嚟）</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>除唔盡就放棄</strong></td><td>揀可以被分母Divisible嘅數做整體（P3階段）</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>忘記單位</strong></td><td>答案要寫單位（粒、元、頁、人...）</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>幾分之幾同幾倍搞亂</strong></td><td>幾分之幾係&lt;1（除分母乘分子）；幾倍係&gt;1（直接乘）</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic一：「整體除分母搵一份，再乘分子就係答案；分母唔係整體數，呢個Trap最常錯！」</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic二：「先除後乘係次序，搵完一份再計數；唔同整體要小心，計出實數再比較！」</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">搵整體</div><div class="d">總共有幾多？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">除分母</div><div class="d">搵出1份有幾多</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">乘分子</div><div class="d">1份x幾多份</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">寫答案</div><div class="d">連單位！</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;">🌟 「整體嘅幾分之幾」係生活中成日用到嘅技能！分Pizza、分獎品、分時間都要用！你好叻呀！🎉</div>
